OL,3,GNEWSAFamily worried over rig survivor
OL,4,Astuck in Gabon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a Hull man who is unable
OL,7,Fto return home following the sinking of
OL,8,Fan oil rig are becoming increasingly
OL,9,Fconcerned for his welfare.
OL,11,FRichard Richardson, 68, has been
OL,12,Fstaying at a secure hotel complex in
OL,13,FGabon since the disaster on the
OL,14,FProspector 5 on 24 October ` but he is
OL,15,Fnot free to leave, his family say.
OL,17,FJessica Matisak, his daughter, said
OL,18,Fthey were locked in "a crisis with zero
OL,19,Ffeeling of control" as they wait for
OL,20,Fanswers about his return.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
